# Build output. 3 GB and fully reproducible from Cargo.lock.
/target/

# Headless captures land wherever --screenshot is pointed; the ones the docs
# reference live in screenshots/ and are tracked deliberately.
/*.png
/out.png

# Revert binaries. Every batch since 8 builds one before it starts so its control
# flag can be A/B'd against a build without the feature in it, and `--bin harness
# bitexact --exe-b voxelcraft-preNN.exe` is what consumes them. 9 MB each, and
# reproducible from the tree they were built from.
/voxelcraft-pre*.exe

# Edit journals. A saved world is a stream of deltas against the seed, so it is
# reproducible from the seed plus whatever the player did -- and what the player
# did is not something a repository has an opinion about.
/*.journal

# The fixture, copied aside so a rebuild cannot relink it mid-sweep.
/harness-base.exe

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
# Temporary codebase dumps and helper scripts
codebase_dump.txt
gemini-code-*.py


# Local fallback for windowed preferences; normal preference paths are outside the repo.
/.voxelcraft-settings.conf

# Audit artifacts and output
/audit_artifacts/
uploadme.txt

